        "憲": {
          "source": "Digital Daijisen けん【憲】; complete JMdict entries 1158900, 1257580, 1257590, 1551630",
          "coverage": "Fundamental rules, constitution, and regulation/official senses distinguished. Selected ケン is supported by the actual 憲法 article and Joyo row.",
          "restrictions": "憲法's けんぼう is obsolete; 立憲 also has an abbreviated party-name sense. Daijisen's のり is supplementary kun evidence, not merely a name reading.",
          "comparisons": "Law/rule/standard pairs use 法 律 規 則 制 典 準; regulatory or official pairs use 官 公 監 督. Public/official adjective versus officeholder is an English-label distinction, not unrestricted substitution.",
          "notPromoted": "察 and 警 occur in policing vocabulary, but observation or warning alone is not the same as a fundamental law or regulation."
        },
        "監": {
          "source": "Digital Daijisen かん【監】, cross-reference けん and noun げん; complete JMdict entries 1213610, 1213680, 1213720, 1590860, 2580300",
          "coverage": "Watching/regulating, supervisory roles, prison, and separately qualified historical administrative uses. Full 監査 family also contains 鑑査.",
          "restrictions": "ケン is explicitly Go-on in Daijisen despite only appearing as nanori in the pinned KANJIDIC2 record. げん has two archaic JMdict senses. Exact 監物 has no matching JMdict family; its reading is supported by the actual Daijisen character entry, not invented from a compound alignment.",
          "comparisons": "Direct watching, guarding, inspection, control, office/role and historical district comparisons are kept separate; actual titles and complete bodies were inspected. After the first exposure run, 血 白 工 were also read completely; the proposed Starter-safe choices are 白 人 小, not the earlier 皿 塩 乱.",
          "notPromoted": "房 is a room, 禁 prohibits, and 臣 is a retainer/subject: sharing a prison compound, an institution or a component does not alone make these direct synonyms. 政 concerns political affairs rather than every supervisory office."
        },
        "督": {
          "source": "Digital Daijisen とく【督】; complete JMdict entries 1213720, 1401750, 1455390, 1455400 and the three supplementary families",
          "coverage": "Supervision, command/leadership and urging for timely action. Actual 監督 article supports トク; overall job-title meanings are not mechanically allocated to each character.",
          "restrictions": "總督 is search-only in the 総督 family. 基督 is rare ateji, usually kana, with Portuguese source Cristo; it supplies no general スト reading for 督. Daijisen's かみ is supplementary, not selected.",
          "comparisons": "Command and leadership include 将 率 長 主 and existing command/control cards. 催's prompting sense and 責める's independently checked second sense support urging pairs. Request/demand and English direct comparisons are qualified.",
          "notPromoted": "指's finger/pointing, 急's urgency or hurrying, 注's directed attention and 方's direction/method are not made synonyms merely from an English stem, a related activity or a shared compound."
        }
      },
